\textbf{Strategy} & \textbf{Metric} & \textbf{Seed 42} & \textbf{Seed 123} & \textbf{Seed 456} & \textbf{Seed 789} & \textbf{Seed 1024} & \textbf{Mean$\pm$Std} \\
